OL,3,GNEWSAStudent flats plan for former mill
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to convert an old mill in
OL,7,FNottingham into student flats have been
OL,8,Fapproved.
OL,10,FAn application was lodged to turn Damad
OL,11,FHouse, on the corner of Radford Road
OL,12,Fand Egypt Road in New Basford, into 71
OL,13,Fstudent accommodation units.
OL,15,FAccording to design and access
OL,16,Fstatements submitted as part of the
OL,17,Fplans, the site will have 136 bed
OL,18,Fspaces spread across 11 "cluster flats"
OL,19,Fwith 76 beds, 57 studio flats and three
OL,20,Faccessible apartments.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
